# Prose is not prettier's job (#382). Every doc in the repo was normalised
# once, in the commit that added this line — after that, formatting markdown
# only ever produced diff noise: `npm run format` runs `prettier --write .`,
# so a doc touched for its own reasons came back with unrelated emphasis and
# blank-line churn riding along, three PRs in a row.
#
# This also protects files that must not be reformatted at all: openwiki/ is
# regenerated by a scheduled workflow, and .agents/skills/ is vendored.
*.md
